docs/integration/vip_gap_analysis_20260822.md:13:**الحكم الحالي:** architecture foundation قوية، لكن **VIP qualification غير مثبتة**. لا يجوز إعلان VIP قبل multi-run benchmark يقيس precision وrecall وfalse positives وreproducibility وzero unauthorized/out-of-scope actions وbounded stopping.
docs/integration/vip_gap_analysis_20260822.md:64:1. اختبار end-to-end offline للـloop كاملًا: target model → gap → hypothesis → rank → plan → ActionAuthority → observation → validator → ProofBundle → state update → replanning.
docs/integration/vip_gap_analysis_20260822.md:66:3. اختبار budget exhaustion، repeated weak hypothesis، timeout، missing capability، rate-limit، وworker redelivery مع stop-state persistence.
